{"id":18341,"name":"Cumberland County","slug":"cumberland-county","state":"Pennsylvania","code":"PA","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/pennsylvania-tax-deeds/cumberland-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:52:40","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Upset, Judicial, Repository","typicalSaleDate":"Upset Sale: September","bidProcedure":"Premium Bid","deposit":"$500.00","extra":[{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Tax Claim Bureau, Cumberland County"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Bid4Assets.com | Online Real Estate Auctions | County Tax Sale Auctions | Government Auctions"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Cumberland County, PA"},{"label":"Tax Sale Information","value":"Cumberland County Tax Claim Bureau"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"nP3tcqzuVpuBS0RraIjEIdv2WoXmN01Y8mQ9DUreLxyOYFnV8Wc14KJToXAFTljbaCQBvCP2sihpJMAZ\"><iframe title=\"Affordable Properties Up for Grabs! - Cumberland County - Pennsylvania Tax Deed Sale\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/D1qEOfi_lMk?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Affordable-Properties-Up-for-Grabs!---Cumberland-County---Pennsylvania-Tax-Deed-Sale\">Affordable Properties Up for Grabs! &#8211; Cumberland County &#8211; Pennsylvania Tax Deed Sale</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Unlock substantial savings at Cumberland County, Pennsylvania tax sales, where properties are available for up to 90% below market value. The process kicks off with the Upset Tax Sale in September on Bid4Assets, providing an excellent opportunity for real estate investors.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Overview of the Process:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Upset Tax Sale:</strong> Held online via Bid4Assets. Properties are sold subject to existing liens. Registration requires a $35 fee and a $500 deposit. Full payment is due shortly after the auction ends.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Judicial Tax Sale:</strong> In general, properties in this sale are free of most liens. Registration and deposit requirements are similar to those for the Upset Sale.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Repository Sale:</strong> Properties not sold in previous sales are available here. Bids are submitted directly to the Tax Claim Bureau. Sales are subject to approval by taxing authorities, and properties are sold free of most liens.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Prepare-for-the-Sale\">Steps to Prepare for the Sale</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Register on Bid4Assets</strong>: Complete the registration by September, with a $35 fee and a $500 deposit.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Review Property Listings</strong>: Listings will be available online by mid-July.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Attend the Online Sale</strong>: Participate in the online auction on Bid4Assets.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Complete Payment</strong>: Winners must settle their payments.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Old-Cumberland-County-Courthouse-in-Carlisle.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Old-Cumberland-County-Courthouse-in-Carlisle-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Old-Cumberland-County-Courthouse-in-Carlisle-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Old-Cumberland-County-Courthouse-in-Carlisle-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Old-Cumberland-County-Courthouse-in-Carlisle-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Old-Cumberland-County-Courthouse-in-Carlisle-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Old-Cumberland-County-Courthouse-in-Carlisle.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Old-Cumberland-County-Courthouse-in-Carlisle.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Old-Cumberland-County-Courthouse-in-Carlisle-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Old-Cumberland-County-Courthouse-in-Carlisle-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Old-Cumberland-County-Courthouse-in-Carlisle-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Old-Cumberland-County-Courthouse-in-Carlisle-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Old-Cumberland-County-Courthouse-in-Carlisle-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18344 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Old Cumberland County Courthouse in Carlisle\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\