reau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Cumberland County Tax Claim Bureau</mark></a></a> page​ for more details on the Cumberland County tax lien and tax deed sales</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions\">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What are the key dates for the Cumberland County tax sale?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: The Upset Sale is in September.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How can I register to bid?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Register through Bid4Assets by September, with a $35 fee and a $500 deposit.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Where can I find the property listings?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Listings will be available online by mid-July.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cumberlandcountypa.gov/2277/Tax-Claims-Bureau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Cumberland County Tax Claim Bureau</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cumberlandcountypa.gov/2735/Upset-Real-Estate-Tax-Sale\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Upset Real Estate Tax Sale</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cumberlandcountypa.gov/2739/Judicial-Real-Estate-Tax-Sale\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Judicial Real Estate Tax Sale</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cumberlandcountypa.gov/2282/County-Repository-Sales\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-viv